paragraph -->\n<p>The homepage is simple and effective, providing the space you need to tell your story and outline your services. Extra pages include an about page, services page, contact page and blog. You can, of course, add any extra pages you like.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2>Key features of the Psychiatrist Clinic template</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>Approachable and accessible design suitable for the niche</li><li>Calm green and whitespace offers reassurance</li><li>Lots of content areas to build your page your way</li><li>Fully customizable design that you can design as you like</li><li>Compatible with leading page builders for ease of use</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\";s:12:\"post-excerpt\";s:84:\"A professional template designed to reflect the personal, caring nature of the niche\";s:5:\"pages\";a:4:{s:8:\"id-59034\";a:12:{s:5:\"title\";s:7:\"Contact\";s:18:\"featured-image-url\";s:86:\"https://websitedemos.net/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/psychiatrist-clinic-04-contact.jpg\";s:19:\"thumbnail-image-url\";s:86:\"https://websitedemos.net/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/psychiatrist-clinic-04-contact.jpg\";s:18:\"astra-page-api-url\";s:70:\"https://websitedemos.net/psychiatrist-clinic-04/wp-json/wp/v2/pages/21\";s:12:\"dynamic-page\";s:2:\"no\";s:14:\"astra-page-url\";s:50:\"//websitedemos.net/psychiatrist-clinic-04/contact/\";s:15:\"astra-sites-tag\";a:1:{i:415;s:7:\"contact\";}s:15:\"site-pages-type\";s:11:\"agency-mini\";s:23:\"site-pages-page-builder\";s:9:\"elementor\";s:19:\"site-pages-category\";a:0:{}s:26:\"site-pages-parent-category\";a:1:{i:60;s:8:\"business\";}s:16:\"required-plugins\";a:2:{i:0;a:3:{s:4:\"slug\";s:9:\"elementor\";s:4:\"init\";s:23:\"elementor/elementor.php\";s:4:\"name\";s:9:\"Elementor\";}i:1;a:3:{s:4:\"slug\";s:12:\"wpforms-lite\";s:4:\"init\";s:24:\"wpforms-lite/wpforms.php\";s:4:\"name\";s:12:\"WPForms Lite\";}}}s:8:\"id-59035\";a:12:{s:5:\"title\";s:4:\"Home\";s:18:\"featured-im