or\";}i:1;a:3:{s:4:\"slug\";s:12:\"wpforms-lite\";s:4:\"init\";s:24:\"wpforms-lite/wpforms.php\";s:4:\"name\";s:12:\"WPForms Lite\";}}s:11:\"post-status\";s:7:\"publish\";s:12:\"post-content\";s:1059:\"<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Want your homestay to run on 100% occupancy? You can promote your homestay and accept online reservations from a global audience by having an online presence. The elegantly designed Home Stay web template helps you launch your website quickly.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The design transports you to the serenity and tranquility of living in the countryside. The template has everything you need to build an informative and engaging website, from showcasing the rooms to the property facilities.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2>Key features of the Home Stay template</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>Simple and clean design that gives a rustic and countryside look and feel</li><li>Significant hero image perfect for promoting the homestay</li><li>The homepage features the amenities and customer reviews</li><li>Google map is integrated to help prospective customers locate the property</li><li>Full compatibility with leading page builders</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\";s:12:\"post-excerpt\";s:87:\"A simple and clean website design that’s perfect for a homestay accommodation website\";s:5:\"pages\";a:5:{s:8:\"id-55688\";a:12:{s:5:\"title\";s:5:\"About\";s:18:\"featured-image-url\";s:74:\"https://websitedemos.net/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/home-stay-02-about.jpg\";s:19:\"thumbnail-image-url\";s:74:\"https://websitedemos.net/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/home-stay-02-about.jpg\";s:18:\"astra-page-api-url\";s:60:\"https://websitedemos.net/home-stay-04/wp-json/wp/v2/pages/11\";s:12:\"dynamic-page\";s:2:\"no\";s:14:\"astra-page-url\";s:38:\"//websitedemos.net/home-stay-04/about/\";s:15:\"astra-sites-tag\";a:1:{i:352;s:5:\"about\";}s:15:\"site-pages-type\";s:11:\"agency-mini\";s:23:\"sit